@base = http://localhost:8000
@clientPassword = Client-one-demo-2026!
@employeePassword = Employee-demo-2026!
@token = paste-access-token-here
@employeeToken = paste-employee-token-here
@applicationId = paste-application-id-here

### 1. Login: copy access_token from the response into @token
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=client1&password={{clientPassword}}

### 2. Current user
GET {{base}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Prefilled company
GET {{base}}/api/v1/company
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Products
GET {{base}}/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Save a partial draft; copy id into @applicationId
POST {{base}}/api/v1/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"product_code":"working_capital","requested_amount":"300000.00","term_months":12,"purpose":"Закупка материалов"}

### 6. Fill financial data; use the current revision returned by GET
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/applications/{{applicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"revision":1,"average_monthly_revenue":"1000000.00","average_monthly_operating_expenses":"600000.00","existing_monthly_debt_payment":"50000.00"}

### 7. Read the draft again after restarting backend
GET {{base}}/api/v1/applications/{{applicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Own applications only
GET {{base}}/api/v1/applications?limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Delete an unsent draft (only status DRAFT)
DELETE {{base}}/api/v1/applications/{{applicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Sign in as employee; copy access_token into @employeeToken
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=employee&password={{employeePassword}}

### 11. Employee queue and full application card
GET {{base}}/api/v1/bank/applications?status=UNDER_REVIEW
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

GET {{base}}/api/v1/bank/applications/{{applicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### 12. Choose one action for an application
POST {{base}}/api/v1/bank/applications/{{applicationId}}/request-info
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"comment":"Уточните среднемесячную выручку за последние 12 месяцев."}

### Alternatively, approve or reject instead of requesting information
POST {{base}}/api/v1/bank/applications/{{applicationId}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision":"REJECTED","comment":"Доход после расходов не позволяет обслуживать кредит."}

### 9. Application and database readiness
GET {{base}}/ready
